{
  "format": "sfxgen/1",
  "name": "Jet fly-by",
  "description": "A fighter jet crossing low and fast over an airfield: almost nothing until it is on you, the compressor whine arriving first and thin, then the pass, and behind it the real sound: the tearing, crackling roar of the exhaust that drops in pitch and takes a long time to roll away, hollowed by its reflection off the runway. Left to right, in stereo.",
  "tags": ["vehicle", "jet", "aircraft", "plane", "fighter", "fly-by", "doppler", "roar"],
  "duration": 6.5,
  "seed": 18,
  "output": {
    "channels": 2
  },
  "tracks": [
